Job Description

As a Frontend Developer Intern at HelloPrint, you'll work on challenging projects and help us realize our mission to become Earth’s largest platform for printed products. Our technical team is going rocket-fast and we are looking for someone to help us go even faster.

We are looking for eager-to-learn interns who are looking for an opportunity to learn and improve their skills while adding real value to our customers. We work in multidisciplinary teams where Business & Tech work on the same goals and are obsessed with building the best environment for our customers.

What We Expect

As a Frontend Developer Intern at HelloPrint, you work together with our Frontend developers and learn from them the best approach to create the ideal customer journey. You collaborate with our UI/UX designer, take the designs and mockups and make them a reality. Once you see that something is broken, you propose how to fix it to make sure our customers get the best experience... possible.

What you do:
• Work with HTML, CSS, SCSS, Javascript, Vue.js, jQuery
• Take ownership of small improvements and participate in bigger projects alongside other developers
• Work closely together with developers, product owner, business and other stakeholders;
• Do it together (one of our cultural values)

Job Requirements

What we’re looking for:
• You are doing a bachelor's or master's degree in computer science or related studies and you can provide a university agreement - note that being enrolled in a university is a hard requirement for this internship;
• You are available for a minimum period of 20 weeks;
• You have strong JavaScript, HTML and CSS foundations and practical experience with front-end technologies;
• Proactive attitude - you want to get things done and make an impact;
• Eagerness to learn;
• Professional level of English;

Some extra pluses:
• Experience with design tools like Figma
• Experience with GIT and working with agile methodology.

Why HelloPrint
• HelloPrint is Great Place To Work-Certified™;
• A unique culture and challenges at a fast-growing e-commerce company;
• Dynamic, entrepreneurial and international environment (34 nationalities & average age of 30);
• A great community of like-minded young professionals in Valencia;
• Opportunities to grow and to Design Yourself in a fast-paced learning curve;
• The best events, Friday drinks & free Spanish classes;
• Attractive discounts on Urban Sports Club to enjoy a broad variety of sports whenever and wherever
• A free Bueno Bootcamp and attractive discounts on Urban Sports Club to enjoy a broad variety of sports
• Breakfast, Lunch and healthy snacks are on us. Enough to keep you going all day!

Are you ready?

2024: Year of Performance at HelloPrint. We're looking for individuals with energy, a drive for results, eagerness to learn, and strong communication skills. Step out of your comfort zone and join us in making a difference. Kick off your performance and growth adventure at HelloPrint and discover our culture through our 6 Core Values. Ready? Apply today!

Once we receive your application and our first impression is positive, we'll contact you to discuss the steps in our hiring process. We aim to ensure that you and HelloPrint culture are a good match

